  "arxiv_text": "We extracted last-token hidden state representations from Mistral-7B-Instruct-v0.3 at all 33 layers (embeddings + 32 transformer blocks) for each of the 140 Gold paragraphs, and trained an independent L2-regularized multinomial logistic regression per layer to predict the temporal epoch (4 classes) from that representation alone, using 5-fold stratified cross-validation. The best-performing layer (layer 19) achieves 45.0% accuracy (chance: 25.0%, majority-class baseline: 30.7%), a difference confirmed significant by a 200-permutation test (p=0.0050)."
